# Paths Semgrep never scans (contrib/semgrep/README.md). Semgrep scans git-tracked files only; this file
# replaces its built-in ignore list, so the usual build and cache directories are named here too.
.venv/
build/
dist/
.work/
data/local/
reports/
# The vendored reference model: byte-for-byte copies (or extracts) of boyfromcave/ycash6 test-framework files, pinned
# by sha256 in src/ybcal/model/VENDOR.json / VENDOR_V3.json and checked by `ybcal verify`. Editing them
# breaks parity; their findings are ycash6's to fix, where its own Semgrep scan covers the originals.
src/ybcal/model/reference*.py
# Test cases for this repository's own rules (semgrep --test contrib/semgrep/rules): they match on purpose.
contrib/semgrep/rules/*.py
